  "details": "Toggling off gestures in the AM causes all transform animations to stop working on the worn avatar. I can see the states transitioning normally on the FX layer in the debug menu, but visually nothing happens. Even things like flight colliders etc stop functioning, all transforms frozen. Reloading the avatar or changing out and back in has no effect. Only way to restore functionality is to toggle gestures back on. Using oculus controllers.\n\navtr_21821391-5cf0-48ad-b2f6-9621dbe13d2a",
